/T (He views cloud computing and DevOps not merely as toolsets, but as an essential operational culture that bridges software development with scalable, production-ready infrastructure deployment. With over nine years of frontline industry experience across software engineering, application development, and cloud platform automation, Shubham operates adeptly at the intersection of Linux administration, container orchestration, CI/CD automation, and cloud services. Throughout his technical career, he has worked across product-based startups and service enterprises, mastering stacks that include Python, AWS, Docker, Kubernetes, and Terraform to build and scale production environments.)
/E (He views cloud computing and DevOps not merely as toolsets, but as an essential operational culture that bridges software development with scalable, production-ready infrastructure deployment. With over nine years of frontline industry experience across software engineering, application development, and cloud platform automation, Shubham operates adeptly at the intersection of Linux administration, container orchestration, CI/CD automation, and cloud services. Throughout his technical career, he has worked across product-based startups and service enterprises, mastering stacks that include Python, AWS, Docker, Kubernetes, and Terraform to build and scale production environments.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
