/P 283 0 R
/T (Currently serving as Developer Advocate at Amazon Web Services \(AWS\) and Founder/Educator at TrainWithShubham, Shubham leads an active technical learning ecosystem focused on empowering student developers and early-career professionals. Under his guidance, his learning programs and open initiatives have helped over 10,000 learners transition into cloud and platform engineering roles.)
/E (Currently serving as Developer Advocate at Amazon Web Services \(AWS\) and Founder/Educator at TrainWithShubham, Shubham leads an active technical learning ecosystem focused on empowering student developers and early-career professionals. Under his guidance, his learning programs and open initiatives have helped over 10,000 learners transition into cloud and platform engineering roles.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [9]
>>
