<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 283 0 R
/T (As the creator of the viral #90DaysOfDevOps open-source initiative on GitHub, Shubham engineered a structured, project-driven curriculum that guides engineers from fundamental Linux shell navigation and Git version control up to advanced multi-container Kubernetes deployments and Infrastructure as Code \(IaC\) pipelines. Beyond his instructional contributions, Shubham is a passionate community builder who maintains an expansive footprint across developer forums, tech symposiums, and digital learning platforms. Through his regular technical breakdowns, live architecture workshops, and open-source project repositories, he remains dedicated to breaking down technical barriers for engineering undergraduates, elevating industry readiness, and mentoring future cloud infrastructure talent.)
/E (As the creator of the viral #90DaysOfDevOps open-source initiative on GitHub, Shubham engineered a structured, project-driven curriculum that guides engineers from fundamental Linux shell navigation and Git version control up to advanced multi-container Kubernetes deployments and Infrastructure as Code \(IaC\) pipelines. Beyond his instructional contributions, Shubham is a passionate community builder who maintains an expansive footprint across developer forums, tech symposiums, and digital learning platforms. Through his regular technical breakdowns, live architecture workshops, and open-source project repositories, he remains dedicated to breaking down technical barriers for engineering undergraduates, elevating industry readiness, and mentoring future cloud infrastructure talent.)
