/T (Being a good listener and avoiding negative conversations can also help create a more respectful environment. Attractiveness has physical, mental, emotional and spiritual layers. Physically, it means neat footwear, a fit body, good diet and sleep, and a signature personality. Mentally, it means intellectual charm and a touch of mystery. Emotionally, it means remembering names, valuing yourself and being yourself. Spiritually, it comes down to mindfulness, deeper connection, helping without expectation and "paying it forward." The main lesson is that attractiveness is not limited to physical appearance; our behaviour, attitude, confidence and kindness also influence how others see us.)
/E (Being a good listener and avoiding negative conversations can also help create a more respectful environment. Attractiveness has physical, mental, emotional and spiritual layers. Physically, it means neat footwear, a fit body, good diet and sleep, and a signature personality. Mentally, it means intellectual charm and a touch of mystery. Emotionally, it means remembering names, valuing yourself and being yourself. Spiritually, it comes down to mindfulness, deeper connection, helping without expectation and "paying it forward." The main lesson is that attractiveness is not limited to physical appearance; our behaviour, attitude, confidence and kindness also influence how others see us.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
