/T (Humour reduces stress, improves health and helps communication. It works at three levels: a smile, hearty laughter and sarcasm, which is best avoided. Adults laugh far less than children \(about 4 times a day versus 300\). Humour makes interactions more enjoyable and helps people connect with each other. It can also make difficult conversations easier by reducing tension and creating a comfortable atmosphere.)
