716 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 292 0 R
/T (Among the many traditional art forms of Tamil Nadu, Bharatanatyam is the one that has carried our culture across the centuries. It began inside the temples, where devadasis performed it as an offering to the deity. The epic Silappathikaram describes classical dance in detail, and the carvings on the Brihadeeswarar Temple at Thanjavur and the Chidambaram Nataraja Temple show its postures in stone. In the nineteenth century, the Thanjavur Quartet organised the repertoire into the form we see today.)
/E (Among the many traditional art forms of Tamil Nadu, Bharatanatyam is the one that has carried our culture across the centuries. It began inside the temples, where devadasis performed it as an offering to the deity. The epic Silappathikaram describes classical dance in detail, and the carvings on the Brihadeeswarar Temple at Thanjavur and the Chidambaram Nataraja Temple show its postures in stone. In the nineteenth century, the Thanjavur Quartet organised the repertoire into the form we see today.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
717 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 292 0 R
/T (Traditionally, a dancer trains for many years under a guru. A performance blends nritta \(pure rhythm\), nritya \(expressive storytelling\) and natya \(drama\), told through hand gestures called mudras, facial expressions and Carnatic music. The dancer wears a bright silk costume, temple jewellery and ankle bells called salangai. The first full solo performance, the arangetram, marks the end of a student's formal training.)
/E (Traditionally, a dancer trains for many years under a guru. A performance blends nritta \(pure rhythm\), nritya \(expressive storytelling\) and natya \(drama\), told through hand gestures called mudras, facial expressions and Carnatic music. The dancer wears a bright silk costume, temple jewellery and ankle bells called salangai. The first full solo performance, the arangetram, marks the end of a student's formal training.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [21]
>>
endobj
718 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 292 0 R
/T (Today, many young people feel the art form is old-fashioned and too expensive to learn. Modern initiatives can change this. Schools and colleges can include classical dance in cultural clubs and the curriculum, as institutions like Kalakshetra in Chennai already do. Online classes, recorded performances and social media reels can reach learners in small towns. Festivals such as the Margazhi season in Chennai give young artists a stage, and scholarships can help families who cannot afford training.)
/E (Today, many young people feel the art form is old-fashioned and too expensive to learn. Modern initiatives can change this. Schools and colleges can include classical dance in cultural clubs and the curriculum, as institutions like Kalakshetra in Chennai already do. Online classes, recorded performances and social media reels can reach learners in small towns. Festivals such as the Margazhi season in Chennai give young artists a stage, and scholarships can help families who cannot afford training.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [22]
>>
endobj
