/T (A regional folk art and handicraft fair is a colourful meeting of tradition and community. Walking through the fair grounds, visitors see Karagattam and Oyilattam performances, hear the beat of the parai drum, and watch artisans make Thanjavur dolls, palm-leaf baskets, clay pots and silk sarees. The air smells of fresh filter coffee, murukku, adhirasam and hot sundal.)
/E (A regional folk art and handicraft fair is a colourful meeting of tradition and community. Walking through the fair grounds, visitors see Karagattam and Oyilattam performances, hear the beat of the parai drum, and watch artisans make Thanjavur dolls, palm-leaf baskets, clay pots and silk sarees. The air smells of fresh filter coffee, murukku, adhirasam and hot sundal.)
