1186 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 305 0 R
/T (Internships help early-stage engineering students connect classroom theory with real work. Today, students can choose between remote \(virtual\) and on-site \(physical\) internships, and each has advantages and disadvantages. Hands-on skill acquisition is the biggest difference. On-site internships give direct access to machines, laboratories and real equipment, so students learn practical skills such as wiring, fabrication and testing. Remote internships, in contrast, mostly involve software, simulations and online tasks, which are useful for coding and design but cannot replace physical practice.)
/E (Internships help early-stage engineering students connect classroom theory with real work. Today, students can choose between remote \(virtual\) and on-site \(physical\) internships, and each has advantages and disadvantages. Hands-on skill acquisition is the biggest difference. On-site internships give direct access to machines, laboratories and real equipment, so students learn practical skills such as wiring, fabrication and testing. Remote internships, in contrast, mostly involve software, simulations and online tasks, which are useful for coding and design but cannot replace physical practice.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
1187 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 305 0 R
/T (In terms of schedule flexibility, remote internships win clearly. Students can work from home, save travel time and cost, and manage studies alongside the internship. On-site internships, on the other hand, demand fixed hours and daily travel, which can be tiring during the semester.)
/E (In terms of schedule flexibility, remote internships win clearly. Students can work from home, save travel time and cost, and manage studies alongside the internship. On-site internships, on the other hand, demand fixed hours and daily travel, which can be tiring during the semester.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [6]
>>
