/E (Operating costs also differ. EVs have fewer moving parts, so they need less maintenance, and electricity per kilometre is cheaper than petrol or diesel. On the other hand, ICE vehicles cost less to buy, and their repair shops are available everywhere. Fuel prices, however, keep rising and make them costly to run.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
