/E (Charging network feasibility is the biggest challenge for EVs. Charging stations are still limited, especially on highways and in small towns, and charging takes much longer than refuelling. ICE vehicles, conversely, can be refuelled in minutes at petrol stations spread across the country.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
