/Parent 4205 0 R
/Prev 4260 0 R
/Next 4269 0 R
>>
endobj
4269 0 obj
<<
/Title (I also took part in my first technical club activity and a small hackathon. Working with a team to build a solution within a limited time was challenging and thrilling, and I learned a lot about teamwork and debugging from my seniors.)
/Dest [37 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4205 0 R
/Prev 4268 0 R
/Next 4261 0 R
>>
endobj
4270 0 obj
<<
