4271 0 obj
<<
/Title (How are you? I hope college and work are going well. I am writing because I need your advice on something I am struggling with.)
/Dest [38 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4238 0 R
/Prev 4264 0 R
/Next 4273 0 R
>>
endobj
4272 0 obj
<<
/Title (Since you have handled the same situation, could you please tell me how you balanced your academics with the clubs? I would also like your tips for semester exam revision, such as how to plan the timetable, which subjects to start with, and how to use previous question papers.)
/Dest [38 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4238 0 R
/Prev 4274 0 R
/Next 4265 0 R
>>
endobj
4273 0 obj
<<
/Title (My day starts at 6:30 a.m., and I attend classes until 4:30 p.m. After that, I go to my technical club meetings for about two hours, and in the evening I try to study and finish my assignments. By the time I am free, I am usually very tired.)
/Dest [38 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4238 0 R
/Prev 4271 0 R
/Next 4274 0 R
>>
endobj
4274 0 obj
<<
/Title (My biggest challenge is managing the lab record submissions. Because the records must be completed every week, they pile up, and I often finish them at the last minute, which affects the quality.)
/Dest [38 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4238 0 R
/Prev 4273 0 R
/Next 4272 0 R
>>
